false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[39,24,79,79,72,39],"title":-1,"rank":"4","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1024905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[39,24,79,79,72,39],"title":-1,"rank":"4","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1024905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1012","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[39,24,79,79,72,39],"title":-1,"rank":"4","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1024905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[39,24,79,79,72,39],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"96","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1024905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10314","city":"CS1012","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[39,24,79,79,72,39],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"96","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1024905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"辛评之弟，二人共仕袁绍。袁绍死后。辛毗作为袁谭使者前往曹营求援。在邺城包围战中，审配以杀鸡儆猴为由将辛毗全族上下八十余口于城墙上斩首，并把头颅掷于城下。曹操处死审配后辛毗改仕曹操。曹操死后与其他魏臣逼位献帝，使曹丕称魏帝。五丈原之战时勒令死守、诸将不得出兵，被司马懿称为知心者。","tc":"辛評之弟，二人共仕袁紹。袁紹死后。辛毗作為袁譚使者前往曹營求援。在鄴城包圍戰中，審配以殺雞儆猴為由將辛毗全族上下八十余口于城墻上斬首，并把頭顱擲于城下。曹操處死審配后辛毗改仕曹操。曹操死后與其他魏臣逼位獻帝，使曹丕稱魏帝。五丈原之戰時勒令死守、諸將不得出兵，被司馬懿稱為知心者。","en":"Younger brother of Xin Ping, both serving Yuan Shao. After Yuan Shao's death, Xin Pi served as Yuan Tan's envoy to Cao Cao's camp to request aid. During the siege of Ye, Shen Pei made an example of Xin Pi by executing his entire clan of over eighty members atop the city wall and hurling their heads below. After Cao Cao executed Shen Pei, Xin Pi entered Cao Cao's service. Following Cao Cao's death, he joined other Wei ministers in pressuring Emperor Xian to abdicate in favor of Cao Pi. During the Battle of Wuzhangyuan, he enforced the order to hold fast and forbade any offensive action, earning Sima Yi's praise as one who truly understood his heart.","jp":"辛評の弟。兄弟で共に袁紹に仕えた。袁紹の死後、辛毗は袁譚の使者として曹操陣営へ救援を求めた。鄴城包囲戦において、審配は鶏を殺して猿を戒める見せしめとして辛毗の一族80余名を城壁の上で斬首し、その首を城下へ投げ落とした。曹操が審配を処刑した後、辛毗は曹操に仕えた。曹操の死後は他の魏臣と共に献帝に迫って退位させ、曹丕を魏帝に即位させた。五丈原の戦いでは死守を命じて諸将の出兵を禁じ、司馬懿から心を知る者と称された。","kr":"신평의 아우로, 두 사람은 함께 원소를 섬겼다. 원소가 죽은 뒤, 신비는 원담의 사신으로 조조의 진영에 가 구원을 요청했다. 업성 포위전 당시, 심배는 닭을 잡아 원숭이를 경계한다는 구실로 성벽 위에서 신비의 일족 80여 명을 참수하고 그 머리를 성 아래로 내던졌다. 조조가 심배를 처형한 후 신비는 조조를 섬기게 되었다. 조조가 사망하자 다른 위나라 신하들과 함께 헌제에게 양위를 강요하여 조비가 위나라 황제에 오르게 했다. 오장원 전투 때는 사수를 명하여 여러 장수가 출병하지 못하게 엄히 단속하였으며, 사마의에게 참으로 마음을 알아주는 자(知己)라 칭해졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10315","remark":"","surname":"辛","surnameTc":"辛","surnameEn":"Xin","surnameJp":"辛","surnameKr":"신","surnameOther":"","name":"毗","nameTc":"毗","nameEn":"Pi","nameJp":"毗","nameKr":"비","nameOther":"","word":"佐治","wordTc":"佐治","wordEn":"Zuozhi","wordJp":"佐治","wordKr":"좌치","wordOther":"","icon":"辛毗","power":"WJ10314","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"189","city":"CS1013","gender":"0","rule":"39","force":"24","wise":"79","politics":"79","charm":"72","will":"39","ruleTalent":"3","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"7/7/7/7